WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.385 --> 00:00:02.760
I'm attending one of the health
professional schools here

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:03.590
at BU.

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:05.480
And the prerequisites,
of course,

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.860
were, like, anatomy,
physiology, biology.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:08.430
And yet--

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:09.900
Those are all
offensive and terrible.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:10.170
Yeah.

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:10.669
[LAUGHTER]

00:00:10.669 --> 00:00:12.270
That seems to be the case.

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:14.810
We've discussed quite a
bit about transgenderism

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:18.267
and whatnot, even more than,
say, cardiovascular disease.

00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:19.600
And we've even had assignments--

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:20.600
That makes sense, yeah.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:21.630
I know, right?

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:24.770
We've even had assignments
where you would get docked off

00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:27.080
or not get the points if you
didn't say that you would,

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:29.310
let's say, even
change their gender

00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:32.850
and in the medical profile
to the gender that they say,

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:34.770
which I think is just
terrible, considering--

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:35.440
It's idiotic.

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:35.940
Yeah.

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:37.387
It's fully idiotic.

00:00:37.387 --> 00:00:38.970
If it says on your
profile that you're

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:41.430
a member of the sex to
which you do not belong,

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.560
then you're going to get
profiled medically wrong.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:44.460
Certainly.

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:47.340
If you're having lower stomach
pain, and it says on your chart

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:49.310
that you are a man, we're going
to be looking at indigestion.

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:50.610
If it says you're a
woman, we're going

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:51.880
to be looking at something else.

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:52.380
OK?

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:53.500
This is idiotic.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:54.000
Yeah.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:54.920
So going off that.

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:58.140
I guess you were
starting to discuss it.

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.540
I just wanted to know what
your opinion was on, sort of,

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:01.581
the implications of this.

00:01:01.581 --> 00:01:03.950
Not only, like, a
culturally significant issue

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:05.200
that you've talked about more.

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.517
Invading it in more hardcore
science institutions,

00:01:07.517 --> 00:01:09.350
especially considering
your wife's a doctor.

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:11.074
Yeah, she is.

00:01:11.074 --> 00:01:11.740
As you may know.

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:13.440
Yeah.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:16.020
So I think it's egregious.

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:17.620
I think that biology is biology.

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:19.037
It's amazing to
me that people who

00:01:19.037 --> 00:01:20.411
proclaim that they
are scientists

00:01:20.411 --> 00:01:22.078
are so willing to
overlook basic biology

00:01:22.078 --> 00:01:24.411
and proclaim that people who
are fully biologically male

00:01:24.411 --> 00:01:26.190
can magically become
biologically female.

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:27.810
We're not talking about
people who are intersex.

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:30.268
I always like when people who
debate this issue immediately

00:01:30.268 --> 00:01:32.770
go to the marginal
issues where there actual

00:01:32.770 --> 00:01:34.920
is blurring of the lines,
people who are intersex,

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:36.420
or they have some
genetic condition.

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:38.010
They have Klinefelter's
syndrome or something.

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:38.250
Right?

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:39.600
That's not what we're
talking about here.

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.725
The actual argument of the
transgender civil rights

00:01:41.725 --> 00:01:44.190
movement is that people
who are fully male

00:01:44.190 --> 00:01:46.560
can actually become
fully female.

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:48.060
That is obvious nonsense.

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:49.860
It's obviously nonsense.

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:53.970
And, again, the very
idea that a doctor

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:55.860
is supposed to sit
there and profile you

00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:57.690
based on what you
wish you were is

00:01:57.690 --> 00:02:00.325
so insane and stupid
and counterproductive.

00:02:00.325 --> 00:02:01.950
I mean, if you're a
transgender person,

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:03.866
would you really want
the doctor profiling you

00:02:03.866 --> 00:02:05.910
based along the lines of
organs you don't have?

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:08.729
If you're a biological man, do
you want to walk into a doctor,

00:02:08.729 --> 00:02:11.700
and he's trying to figure
out how to fix your uterus?

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:12.804
You don't have one.

00:02:12.804 --> 00:02:13.470
It's ridiculous.

00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:16.480
[QUIET LAUGHTER]

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:18.172
That stuff is just
beyond the pale.

00:02:18.172 --> 00:02:20.130
But it does demonstrate
the full-scale insanity

00:02:20.130 --> 00:02:21.349
that now predominates.

00:02:21.349 --> 00:02:23.640
And again, you know, I've
had this argument 1,000 times

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:24.900
with folks, obviously.

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:27.210
And the use of
politics above science

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:29.629
is obvious in everything from
what you're talking about,

00:02:29.629 --> 00:02:31.920
to even the rewriting of the
Diagnostic and Statistical

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:34.890
Manual of the latest edition,
which is completely ascientific

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:37.710
based on no statistical
evidence and was essentially

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:41.490
a political decision to
relabel gender dysphoria

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:43.350
from a mental illness
or mental disorder,

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:45.214
it was called a mental disorder.

00:02:45.214 --> 00:02:46.630
It's not a mental
disorder at all.

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:47.940
It's just the depression
associated with it

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:48.670
that's a mental disorder.

00:02:48.670 --> 00:02:49.950
Well, by that
definition, schizophrenia

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:51.104
isn't a mental disorder.

00:02:51.104 --> 00:02:52.770
It's only the depression
and suicidality

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.690
they go along with it that
are a mental disorder.

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:56.815
You can literally do that
with any mental disorder.

00:02:59.762 --> 00:03:02.220
Again, for people who proclaim
that they care about science

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:04.290
and facts to say
this kind of stuff,

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:06.980
is ascientific and afactual.

